  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "You want us so much to not share passwords to others. Yet you dont give us any other options to give others access to upload avatars to our accounts.\nAnd even some people manage avatars for their friends.\nIm managing some of my friends avatars since they cant do that stuff themself.\nThe only way i can do that, is knowing their login info...\nYou REALLY need to give us an alternative way like Chillout that have a special key you can give to whoever needs to upload to your account.\nWith a key we can just give that to whoever needs to upload and delete the key after its done.\nThat key should then give permission to upload to the account the key is bound to.\nAnd that will result in no one needing to give away account information to get stuff uploaded to their account.\nIf you really want us to not give away passwords. Then give us this option please.",
